    {
      "id": "L-S2E10-C02",
      "title": "Hope trains Landon.",
      "description": "While sparring, Hope vents about Alyssa Chang. Landon, an expert on bullies, advises her to talk to her, and Hope decides to teach him a basic jab.",
      "participants": [
        {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
        }
      ],
      "subjects": [],
      "scene_type": "conversation",
      "tags": [
        "banter",
        "advice",
        "protect"
      ],
      "importance": 4,
      "verified": true,
      "full": {
        "turns": [
          {
            "id": "L-S2E10-C02-T01",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Okay, that was a little hard."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E10-C02-T02",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Ow."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E10-C02-T03",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "action": "throws Landon to the floor while training"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E10-C02-T04",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Okay, um, to be clear, when I asked for training, I sort of meant for beginners."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E10-C02-T05",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Yeah."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E10-C02-T06",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Sorry. It's just, Alyssa Chang has me all worked up. That girl has no boundaries. She takes all of my stuff and every day she has a new scented candle. One of which that smelled like bacon. I think she's trying to gaslight me."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E10-C02-T07",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Yeah, bullies'll do that. Trust me, I pretty much have a PhD on the subject."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E10-C02-T08",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "She makes me long for the days when I could toss a monster into the Malivore pit."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E10-C02-T09",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Well, I know this might not sound like the most action-packed advice, but, um... maybe just try talking to her. Bullies hate being confronted."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E10-C02-T10",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "I guess I could try that, Dr. Kirby."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E10-C02-T11",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "action": "smiles"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E10-C02-T12",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Great. Uh, how about some more sparring first? Maybe some judo or kenpo? Aikido?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E10-C02-T13",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Why don't we start with a basic jab? Have you walking instead of running head first into danger."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E10-C02-T14",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "action": "smiles"
          }
        ]
      },
