    {
      "id": "L-S2E10-C05",
      "title": "Hope wants to keep Landon safe from the monster.",
      "description": "Hope tells Wade he is delusional about being a fairy. When they find out the Qareen is real Hope wants to keep Landon safe from the monster.",
      "participants": [
        {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope influenced by Qareen"
        },
        {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
        },
        {
          "character": "Wade",
          "version": "Wade"
        },
        {
          "character": "Alyssa",
          "version": "Alyssa"
        }
      ],
      "subjects": [],
      "scene_type": "conversation",
      "tags": [
        "argument",
        "protect",
        "worry"
      ],
      "importance": 3,
      "verified": true,
      "full": {
        "turns": [
          {
            "id": "L-S2E10-C05-T01",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope influenced by Qareen"
            },
            "text": "Don't even think about it."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E10-C05-T02",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Wade",
              "version": "Wade"
            },
            "text": "Why don't you believe me?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E10-C05-T03",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope influenced by Qareen"
            },
            "text": "Can you fly or shoot fairy dust or make others gleeful? No. Because you're doing the exact same thing that Landon is with his training: you're trying to fit in. It's delusional."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E10-C05-T04",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope influenced by Qareen"
            },
            "text": "I sh-shouldn't have said that."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E10-C05-T05",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "You do know the reason I'm training is to help you with this stuff?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E10-C05-T06",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope influenced by Qareen"
            },
            "text": "If I need someone to die a lot, or be picked on, I know who to call."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E10-C05-T07",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope influenced by Qareen"
            },
            "text": "Wade, I'm sorry. I'm sorry. I didn't mean that... I didn't mean that."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E10-C05-T08",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Actually, you did. The Qareen magnifies insecurities. It doesn't make them."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E10-C05-T09",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope influenced by Qareen"
            },
            "action": "sighs"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E10-C05-T10",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Alyssa",
              "version": "Alyssa"
            },
            "text": "Hey, book nerds. There's a monster on campus. It kind of looks like that pimple Hope had last week."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E10-C05-T11",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope influenced by Qareen"
            },
            "text": "Are you sure it wasn't your own reflection?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E10-C05-T12",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Great. It's strong enough to be on our plane."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E10-C05-T13",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope influenced by Qareen"
            },
            "text": "Okay, well, we need to get you somewhere safe just in case. So you don't go get yourself kidnapped again."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E10-C05-T14",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope influenced by Qareen"
            },
            "text": "I'm really not blaming the victim here."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E10-C05-T15",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "I actually don't think it's after me. Like, it actively avoided Wade and me."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E10-C05-T16",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope influenced by Qareen"
            },
            "text": "Then what does it want?"
          }
        ]
      },
