            "speaker": {
              "character": "Josie",
              "version": "Josie"
            },
            "text": "Monster."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E10-C06-T04",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon influenced by Qareen"
            },
            "text": "Uh, Emma put up a barrier spell, so the Qareen's stuck in here with us."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E10-C06-T05",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Josie",
              "version": "Josie"
            },
            "text": "It took the Sandclock."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E10-C06-T06",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope influenced by Qareen"
            },
            "text": "The Sandclock? Why?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E10-C06-T07",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Lizzie",
              "version": "Lizzie"
            },
            "text": "It doesn't matter. We just need to get it back. We can take this thing out, okay? We are three badass witches and one moderately competent bird."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E10-C06-T08",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Josie",
              "version": "Josie"
            },
            "text": "Except if the Sandclock gets damaged, something really bad is gonna happen."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E10-C06-T09",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope influenced by Qareen"
            },
            "text": "We need to exploit a weakness to take it down fast. Except Landon's research into that was about as useful as his fighting skills."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E10-C06-T10",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope influenced by Qareen"
            },
            "text": "Oh, my God, sorry. Love you."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E10-C06-T11",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon influenced by Qareen"
            },
            "text": "Or maybe my research was fine, but God forbid you use your brain instead of punching every problem."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E10-C06-T12",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon influenced by Qareen"
            },
            "text": "Oh, crap. I'm infected."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E10-C06-T13",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Lizzie",
              "version": "Lizzie"
            },
            "text": "Join the club. Maybe the only one that'll have you. Sorry. Monster."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E10-C06-T14",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon influenced by Qareen"
            },
            "text": "Why am I being affected now? I wasn't before."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E10-C06-T15",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon influenced by Qareen"
            },
            "text": "Oh. Okay. I might have a plan."
          }
        ]
      },
