    {
      "id": "L-S2E10-C08",
      "title": "Hope tells Landon she doesn't want him to be the hero since the hero is never the one left standing.",
      "description": "After the fight, Hope tells Landon that what she said under the Qareen's influence was true, that she loves him, and that she won't train him anymore because the hero is never the one left standing. Landon refuses to stop.",
      "participants": [
        {
          "character": "Hope",
