      "importance": 5,
      "verified": true,
      "full": {
        "turns": [
          {
            "id": "L-S2E10-C08-T01",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "That jab is really coming along."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E10-C08-T02",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "I have a good teacher."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E10-C08-T03",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Earlier, I-I said some things..."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E10-C08-T04",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Uh-huh. We both had monster brain. We can forget all about that."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E10-C08-T05",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "I can't. Um, as much as it hurts. Um, what I said was true."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E10-C08-T06",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Look, um... I love you, Landon. I love that you can't take a punch. I love that you won today using brain, not brawn, and I love that you're always trying to be better."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E10-C08-T07",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "But, um, I don't want you to be the hero. Th-The hero's never the one that's left standing."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E10-C08-T08",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "I'm not gonna train you to fight with me anymore. Not if the monsters are back."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E10-C08-T09",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Well, I'm not stopping. If you won't train me, I'll find someone who will, so that we're both standing at the end of this."
          }
        ]
      },
